stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Online
  Online --> Offline: 📡 Network Lost
  Offline --> Recording: 📋 Capture Visit<br/>or Vaccination
  Recording --> PendingSync: 💾 Save to<br/>Local Storage
  PendingSync --> Syncing: 🌐 Network<br/>Restored
  Syncing --> Synced: ✅ Upload<br/>Success
  Syncing --> SyncFailed: ❌ Upload<br/>Error
  SyncFailed --> PendingSync: 🔄 Retry<br/>Sync
  Synced --> Online: ✓ Sync<br/>Complete
